  <in-capmkt:DisclosureOfNotesOnCompositionOfBoardOfDirectorsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="MainD">The term of Shri Manish Bagrodia as Chairman and Managing Director of the Company had expired on June 30, 2024. Further, from July 1, 2024, Shri Manish Bagrodia will continue as Non-Executive Non-Independent Director.

Smt. Mridula Goyal has filed her suo motu resignation on MCA which is against the provision of IBC, 2016 and an application has already been filed before the Hon'ble NCLT by the Resolution Professional to dismiss the resignation which now has been withdrawn accordingly removed from the list of directors.

The Company is under Corporate Insolvency Resolution Process from 22.12.2023, hence no special resolution was passed for re-appointment of Shri Rajiv Chadha as Independent Director.
</in-capmkt:DisclosureOfNotesOnCompositionOfBoardOfDirectorsExplanatoryTextBlock>
